    "Name": "Cephalus Apophis",
    "Details": "This variant Cephalus is a prototype meant to assess the viability of making the chassis capable of surviving direct engagements, particularly hunting down Clan Elementals. The fragile and expensive 250XXL engine is exchanged for a 200-rating Society Light engine, the CLPS is replaced with Ferro-Lamellor, and the Nova CEWS is dropped in favor of Enhanced Imaging and other various FCS and sensor upgrades.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Lifesupport</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
